  "body_html": "<p>When I told my neighbours I was going to keep bees on the balcony, most of them assumed I was joking.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> Two summers later the hive has produced eleven jars of honey.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" href=\"https://substackcdn.example/x.jpeg\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><img src=\"https://substackcdn.example/x.jpeg\" alt=\"A hive on a balcony\"></picture></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">The hive in its first spring.</figcaption></figure></div><h2 class=\"header-anchor-post\">Choosing the hive<div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\"><div id=\"§choosing-the-hive\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset header-anchor offset-top\"></div><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Link\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"><path d=\"M10 13\"></path></svg></button></div></div></h2><p>A top-bar hive needs no heavy supers and lets you inspect one comb at a time.</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thanks for reading The Rooftop Hive! Subscribe for free to receive new posts.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"></form></div></div></div><h2 class=\"header-anchor-post\">Water and neighbours</h2><p>A shallow tray with pebbles keeps the bees at home.</p><blockquote><p>Water close to the hive is the best neighbourly gesture.</p></blockquote><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>One neighbour still thinks it is a joke.</p></div></div>"
}
